.godot/
*.tmp
*.translation
*.swp
export_presets.cfg
build/
docs/vault/.obsidian/
docs/archive/vault/.obsidian/

# Generated art. Every file in these folders is rebuilt from scratch by a script
# in tools/, so the repo carries the generator and not its output — otherwise one
# tweaked constant churns hundreds of binary files in the diff.
assets/sprites/generated/chess/
assets/sprites/generated/tiles/
assets/sprites/generated/maps/
assets/sprites/generated/rooms/
assets/art/piece_templates/

# NOT ignored, on purpose: the PNGs sitting directly in assets/sprites/generated/
# (hero_pawn.png, toy_sword.png, black_pawn.png, ...). Despite the folder name no
# script draws them, so they are source art and a fresh clone needs them.

# NOT ignored, on purpose: assets/art/pieces/. That is hand-drawn source art.
# Nothing regenerates it and losing it loses the work.
